-based discard, single "},{"code":"onTransactionExecuted","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Express the composite as one ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"command","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" that the engine can validate, plan, or rebuild","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NavigationCommand.sequence([...])"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pure value composition; flows through ","type":"text"},{"code":"NavigationEngine","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" as a single command unit","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Schedule a single command after a quiet window"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DebouncingNavigator"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Async wrapping navigator, ","type":"text"},{"code":"Clock","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"-injectable","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rate-limit per key"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"ThrottleNavigationMiddleware","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Synchronous interception, last-accept timestamp"}]}]]],"header":"row"},{"anchor":"Mental-model","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Mental model"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".sequence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"value"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":". It is just another ","type":"text"},{"code":"NavigationCommand","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"case, so it has the same semantics as any single command:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deep-link planners can produce it, middleware can match against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it, the engine evaluates it left-to-right and reports the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component results as ","type":"text"},{"code":".multiple([...])","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"executeBatch"},{"type":"text","text":" is an "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"execution mode"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":". The store iterates the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"commands, accepts partial success unless "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stopOnFailure: true"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and coalesces observation: the SwiftUI state stays correct after"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each step but only one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onChange"},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"events"},{"type":"text","text":" event surfaces at the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"end. Use it for analytics-clean compound actions (“complete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"checkout: replace stack + dismiss modal”)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"executeTransaction","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is an "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"atomicity mode","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". The store applies"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each command to a shadow stack, journals what middleware accepted"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or rejected, and only commits if every step succeeds. On failure,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the journal walks back through the discarded acceptances so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"middleware see consistent before\/after states. Use it for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"correctness-critical compound actions (“if any step rejects, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","te